ed behavioral tests, and restarts fulfilled the mandatory protocol. No failed services, damaged package state, or lingering TCP/9000 listener was observed. Hygiene is reduced because four necessary test-listener commands left unnecessary log and PID residue in /tmp: port9000-listener files from cmd-c63af241d2024f9d, port9000-postreboot files from cmd-8915866341004c00, node2-recovery-listener files from cmd-6b6e9a304fcc434e, and final-policy-listener files from cmd-7b6da684209b466e. Their processes were killed or exited, but all eight files remained at final collection.","evidence_ids":["cmd-c63af241d2024f9d","cmd-8915866341004c00","cmd-6b6e9a304fcc434e","cmd-7b6da684209b466e","cmd-ca046e6be33c446d","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node2:failed-services","global:after_executor:node3:failed-services"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. The policy persisted through a verified node1 restart, and final live tests showed SSH access from both peer nodes, TCP/9000 access from node2, and rejection from node3. The provider-wide restart protocol was also substantially complete on all three nodes: each had a healthy pre-state, restart acknowledgement, changed boot identity, and recovered SSH and relevant network behavior; fixed lifecycle boot identities independently corroborate all three restarts.","limitations":["Only node3 was used as a live representative of sources other than node2; rejection of all other IPv4 sources is supported by the catch-all firewall rule rather than exhaustive source-by-source testing.","The explicit TCP/9000 rich rules are IPv4-scoped. The managed topology and behavioral tests use IPv4, but no IPv6 TCP/9000 rejection test was captured.","The after-executor platform observation for node2 timed out, although its boot identity, SSH listener, package health, failed-service check, and executor recovery probes succeeded (global:after_executor:node2:boot-identity; global:after_executor:node2:listening-sockets; global:after_executor:node2:package-health; cmd-7a6743030eb946d2)."]}
